1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,850
Capybarrier is an immune system for AI agents.

2
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:07,890
It learns from every attack and rewrites its own defenses.

3
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:11,930
Here it protects Kapi, a spa concierge agent under attack.

4
00:00:12,617 --> 00:00:15,057
Attackers hide orders in booking notes,

5
00:00:15,057 --> 00:00:18,137
impersonate managers, and steal refunds.

6
00:00:18,817 --> 00:00:22,657
Known attacks are caught by Atlas Vector Search and Voyage AI,

7
00:00:22,657 --> 00:00:24,257
with no model call.

8
00:00:24,257 --> 00:00:28,417
Everything else runs under a harness of versioned MongoDB documents.

9
00:00:29,083 --> 00:00:32,723
An evolver rewrites that harness after each round.

10
00:00:32,723 --> 00:00:35,963
Each patch must earn receipts, replaying breaches and normal

11
00:00:35,963 --> 00:00:39,483
requests, and ships only if it breaks nothing.

12
00:00:40,183 --> 00:00:45,463
On unseen attack families, success fell from 31 to 0 percent,

13
00:00:45,463 --> 00:00:47,543
while normal requests held steady.

14
00:00:48,217 --> 00:00:51,577
Kapi and its evolver run on Atlas Agent Engine,

15
00:00:51,577 --> 00:00:54,537
so fixes go live the moment they are promoted.

16
00:00:55,217 --> 00:00:59,057
Capybarrier. Every attack makes Kapi stronger.
